  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業巡禮",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY TOUR",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹產業現況，邀請業師到校演講、並規劃企業參訪與移地教學等，讓學生瞭解就業市場所需知識與人才，使其依據個人興趣分流修習課程，建構學習地圖，規劃學習方向。",
    "describe_eh": "This course mainly introduces the current situation of the industries, invites the industrial teachers to give lectures, and plans corporate visits and field trips, so that students can understand the knowledge and talents needed in the job market. Students can divert according to their personal interests, courses, construct learning maps, and planning learning directions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
